  <LocalizedText>
    <Text id="LOC_MODERN_CHINA_MOD_TITLE">
      <en_US>Modern China Civilization Pack</en_US>
      <zh_Hans_CN>现代中国文明包</zh_Hans_CN>
    </Text>
    <Text id="LOC_MODERN_CHINA_MOD_TEASER">
      <en_US>New Civilization: Modern China, Leaders: Mao and Qian Xuesen</en_US>
      <zh_Hans_CN>新文明「现代中国」，领袖「毛」与「钱学森」</zh_Hans_CN>
    </Text>
    <Text id="LOC_MODERN_CHINA_MOD_DESCRIPTION">
      <en_US>Adds the Modern China civilization with Mao and Qian Xuesen, the Congress district, the Red Army unit, Qian's Mechanics Class, and the exclusive governor Zhu.</en_US>
      <zh_Hans_CN>加入「现代中国」文明及其领袖毛、钱学森，包含特色区域「代表大会」、特色单位「红军」、钱学森的「力学班」以及专属总督「朱」。</zh_Hans_CN>
    </Text>
  </LocalizedText>
